## Extending the Module

To extend the module for additional functionality (e.g., supporting new FHIR resources, customizing the bundle), you can:
- Add new classes to handle different FHIR resource types.
- Modify the `PrepareEsmdBundleSubmissionData` class to include additional fields in the bundle.
- Implement custom validation or processing steps in the `EsmdFhirBundleSubmissionResponseProcessor` class.

